galuru, Bengaluru buyer content-native + long-form-friendly + tech-savvy. LinkedIn used for product marketing + talent-acquisition + fund-raising + BD + community-building. Startup-founder-driven ecosystem."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does ITD handle ghostwriting for a SaaS founder without sounding fake?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"6-step voice-capture process: (1) 60-min voice-capture call — you talk, we record + transcribe your voice/style/vocabulary/opinions, (2) 30-min product/vision deep-dive — we understand your product + market + roadmap deeply, (3) Draft written from voice-captured content — writer edits your actual words + insights into publishable post, (4) Weekly 15-min brief calls — we capture fresh material + your current thinking, (5) You review + edit every post before publish (agreed 24-hr approval SLA), (6) Continuous voice refinement based on what resonates + engagement patterns. Result: content that sounds like you (your peers won't detect ghost) because it IS you — we just structure + write + schedule. Top India SaaS founder LinkedIn ghost-writing works this way."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What if I'm raising a Series A/B round + need investor-visible content?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Fund-raising-adjacent LinkedIn strategy: 4-6 months pre-round, systematically build content that: (1) signals traction (metric-transparent + customer-story + retention content), (2) signals category-vision (thought-leadership on your market/moat/why-now), (3) signals team-quality (hiring + team spotlight + culture), (4) signals momentum (velocity of shipping + customer wins + partnerships). Investors research founders extensively on LinkedIn during diligence — your last 6 months of content becomes exhibit A. ITD has run this workflow for multiple India SaaS founders raising Series A/B. In Bengaluru, 55+ lakh LinkedIn members. Densest cluster of SaaS founders + engineering VPs + product managers + design leaders + PE/VC + fintech founders in India. Startup-founder LinkedIn scene very active."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do we track LinkedIn ROI for a Bengaluru SaaS founder or tech CXO?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Weekly: profile views + follower growth + post engagement + newsletter subscriber growth + inbound DMs + LinkedIn Live viewers + connection acceptance. Monthly: qualified inbound customer/investor/candidate DMs + booked meetings + LinkedIn-attributed hires + LinkedIn-attributed pipeline. Quarterly: LinkedIn-attributed ARR + brand-search lift + hiring-attributed to LinkedIn + fund-raising diligence-attributed content review. Realistic: 2-4 months for first meaningful attribution (SaaS founder + tech LinkedIn compounds faster than banking/manufacturing/consulting) + 6-12 months for major ROI + 12-24 months for founder-brand becoming top-3 in category."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does ITD's LinkedIn service for SaaS founders differ from a generic content agency?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"(1) SaaS-native writer team: we understand PLG, activation metrics, cohort retention, ARR/MRR, product-led growth — most agencies can't. (2) LinkedIn-native: we produce for the LinkedIn algorithm (long-form + community + newsletter + Live), not repurposed Twitter/Instagram. (3) Founder + CXO team: senior LinkedIn strategist runs your account (not a junior social manager). (4) Voice-capture ghostwriting quality: our writing passes for authentic founder voice. (5) Fund-raising + hiring + community strategy expertise. (6) Transparent retainer + 6-month MSA + 100% client IP on content + newsletter."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do we start LinkedIn personal branding with ITD as a Bengaluru SaaS founder?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Free 30-min discovery call. We audit your current LinkedIn + benchmark against 5-8 competing India + international SaaS founders in your category + share customised 90-day plan + tier recommendation + first-30-day content plan within 3 working days. If you proceed: 1-week onboarding (60-min voice-capture + product deep-dive + content-approval workflow) + first content live in week 2. Whatsapp us for a quick chat first."}}]}</script>
